  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat. Add sliced red onion and cook, stirring occasionally, until caramelized (5-7 minutes).",
    "Add toasted pecans, allspice, thyme, and cinnamon to the pot. Stir to combine and cook for 1-2 minutes.",
    "Add cod fillets to the pot, skin side up (if they have skin). Cook for 2-3 minutes or until the skin is crispy.",
    "Flip the cod fillets over and add butter to the pot. Once melted, stir to coat the fish.",
    "Add lime juice, honey (if using), and red pepper flakes (if using) to the pot. Stir to combine.",
    "Simmer the tagine over low heat, covered, until the fish is cooked through (8-10 minutes).",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve with rice or over a bed of greens."
  ],
